# Native (Capacitor)
# The icon/splash PNGs are rendered from assets/*.svg by `npm run assets`, so
# the SVGs are the only source worth versioning. The per-platform sizes
# generated into android/ and ios/ are committed, because the native projects
# need them to build.
/assets/*.png
/src/data/library/
/public/assets/
